data: {"id": "888ec02b4aef4c1b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1365", "run_id": "888ec02b4aef4c1b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据分析\n\n### 已确认事实（支持 Terminating 但非 Stuck）\n\n| 维度 | 事实 | 对 TerminatingStuck 的影响 |\n|------|------|--------------------------|\n| **Pod YAML** | `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T08:28:15Z` 已存在 | 确认删除请求已发出 |\n| **Pod YAML** | `finalizers: <none>` | **无 finalizer 卡住** — 排除了 finalizer 阻塞 |\n| **Pod YAML** | `terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 3900` (65分钟) | 删除宽限期很长，尚未超时 |\n| **Pod YAML** | `phase: Running` | Pod 仍在运行，未进入 Terminated |\n| **Pod Describe** | `status: Terminating (lasts <invalid>)` | kubectl 显示 Ter", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789370669011, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

